2151 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Brand Identity \046 Strategy\nExtended Air India\031s brand identity across 83 airports globally\054 designing boarding pass\054 customer experience and brand guidelines to ensure cohesive implementation\056\nLed the end\055to\055end rebranding of a leading Indian natural gas distribution company\054 delivering comprehensive strategy and guidelines for the new identity\056\nCrafted strategic proposal decks\054 converting user research and stakeholder insights into impactful design solutions aligned with business objectives\056\050\nEnvironmental Graphics \046 Immersive Experiences\nDesigned user journeys and environmental graphics for experience centers and corporate spaces for clients to enhance customer experience and brand presence\056\nCross\055functional collaboration in the creation of a virtual museum for a leading aviation company\054 managing end\055to\055end curation\054 research\054 and design of engaging visuals\056\050\nCollaboration \046 Innovation\nConducted 7\053 design thinking workshops for cross\055functional teams\054 fostering innovation through collaborative brainstorming sessions\056\nPartnered with print production vendors to ensure 100\045 accurate execution across all print deliverables\056)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 2152 0 R
